%N A402535 Decimal expansion of (1/3) * Product_{p prime >= 5} (1 - 2/p^2 + 1/p^3).
%C A402535 The density of quartic polynomials of the form x^4 + a*x + b having squarefree discriminant, when pairs(a, b) of integers are ordered by H(a, b) = max{|a|^1/3, |b|^1/4} (Sanjaya and Wang, 2023, Theorem 2).
